        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Popesixtus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b5e925/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Popesixtus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>With the new villains of the multiverse coming our way, is there any chance we could also get solo versions of all these great villains as well? Vengeance isn't our group's preferred play style, and we play on a cramped table in my cramped NYC apartment besides. My preorder is in, &gt;G has my money, but a big stock of villains that our group could plow through one at a time would really make my day.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There have been fan-made adaptations for converting the V5 villains for solo play. And I'm sure there will be more once VotM comes out. But I doubt there will be any \"official\" way to play these outside of the Vengeance format.</p>",
